-------------------------------------------------------------------
Sun Nov  8 12:22:58 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Initial package of emscripten 6.0.3, the last release that
  targets LLVM 23:
  * uses the system clang23, lld23, llvm23 and binaryen instead of
    upstream's LLVM snapshot; C/C++ runtime libraries are built on
    first use into ~/.cache/emscripten
  * emcc expects the binaryen version it is built against, so
    -Werror links do not fail on -Wversion-check
  * acorn and acorn-import-phases vendored via the node_modules
    service; the Closure Compiler is not shipped, so --closure is
    unsupported
  * emscripten-html-minifier-optional.patch: html-minifier-terser
    is not shipped either; skip HTML minification instead of
    failing
  * webidl_binder uses python3-ply and -sSTB_IMAGE uses stb-devel
    instead of the bundled copies

